OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Fcloud and patchy rain will gradually
OL,7,Fclear southwards across southern
OL,8,FEngland and Wales overnight. Isolated
OL,9,Flight showers are possible across
OL,10,Fnorthern Scotland and near North Sea
OL,11,Fcoasts. Otherwise, clear periods with
OL,12,Fsome frost, especially in the
OL,13,Fnorthwest.
OL,14,
OL,15,CMonday:FNorthern Scotland, and the
OL,16,Feast and southeast of England will see
OL,17,Fsome showers on Monday. After a cold
OL,18,Fstart, fine elsewhere with some
OL,19,Fsunshine. A chilly breeze across the
OL,20,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
